WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.276
In this video, you will connect a paid RPC to Krypto Bot.

00:00:04.276 --> 00:00:08.546
An RPC is the line the app uses to talk to the Solana network.

00:00:08.546 --> 00:00:10.268
The free lines work fine.

00:00:10.268 --> 00:00:13.505
A paid one is faster, and it does not get busy.

00:00:13.505 --> 00:00:19.703
First, buy a plan from a provider, like Helius, QuickNode, Triton, or Solana Vibe Station.

00:00:19.703 --> 00:00:20.943
Then follow along.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.111
Start on the Hub.

00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:25.439
That is the home screen with the big tiles.

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:27.822
Click the tile that says Settings and Legal.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.657
You are now in Settings.

00:00:30.657 --> 00:00:34.160
Scroll down until you see the part called Solana RPC.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.201
Everything in this video happens in this part.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.649
If your plan is from Helius, this is the easy way.

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:46.383
Open your Helius dashboard, copy your API key, and paste it into this box.

00:00:46.383 --> 00:00:47.983
That is all Helius needs.

00:00:47.983 --> 00:00:50.286
You can skip ahead to the Save step.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.190
Any other provider gives you two links.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:55.684
One starts with https.

00:00:55.684 --> 00:00:57.451
The other starts with wss.

00:00:57.451 --> 00:00:58.674
Copy the wss link.

00:00:58.674 --> 00:01:05.060
In this box, click at the end of the last line, press Enter to start a new line, and paste it.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.846
Keep the free link that is already there.

00:01:07.846 --> 00:01:10.699
More links means you catch more new coins.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.411
Now copy the https link.

00:01:13.411 --> 00:01:18.159
Scroll down a little to the box called Execution endpoint, and paste it there.

00:01:18.159 --> 00:01:19.559
This is your fast lane.

00:01:19.559 --> 00:01:24.429
Your buys, your sells, and the checks that they went through, all use this link.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:31.097
This box, called HTTP, is for small everyday lookups, and there are a lot of them.

00:01:31.097 --> 00:01:35.722
If your plan has no limit, you can paste the same https link here too.

00:01:35.722 --> 00:01:41.469
If your plan has a limit, leave this box alone, so the lookups do not use up your plan.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.221
When your links are in, click the purple button that says Save RPC settings.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:50.599
Then click Measure, right below it.

00:01:50.599 --> 00:01:55.707
The app tests each link five times, and shows how fast it answered, in milliseconds.

00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:57.349
A smaller number is faster.

00:01:57.349 --> 00:02:01.789
If a link shows an error, you probably missed part of it when you copied.

00:02:01.789 --> 00:02:03.796
Copy it again and paste it again.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:08.512
Do you also trade on BNB Chain or Robinhood?

00:02:08.512 --> 00:02:10.558
Scroll down to EVM chains.

00:02:10.558 --> 00:02:13.548
Each one has a box called Own RPC URL.

00:02:13.548 --> 00:02:18.977
Paste that chain's https link in its box, then click its Save button.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:20.918
That is it.

00:02:20.918 --> 00:02:23.543
Your trades now go through your paid line.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:27.794
If you ever want to go back to free, empty the boxes and click Save.

00:02:27.794 --> 00:02:28.732
One last thing.

00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:30.795
Your link has your key inside it.

00:02:30.795 --> 00:02:32.358
Treat it like a password.

00:02:32.358 --> 00:02:35.921
Never post it in a chat, on a stream, or in a screenshot.
